1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,230
You describe the video.

2
00:00:01,947 --> 00:00:02,767
Claude directs.

3
00:00:03,017 --> 00:00:04,187
showtime does the work,

4
00:00:04,227 --> 00:00:05,247
on your own machine.

5
00:00:05,851 --> 00:00:06,182
Scored

6
00:00:06,206 --> 00:00:10,305
with music and sound, rendered frame
by frame, and checked before it ships.

7
00:00:11,655 --> 00:00:13,979
Launch films, explainers,
vertical shorts,

8
00:00:14,085 --> 00:00:15,589
footage cuts, data stories.

9
00:00:16,379 --> 00:00:17,499
Want options first?

10
00:00:17,749 --> 00:00:19,169
Pick them on a studio board.

11
00:00:19,804 --> 00:00:22,784
No cloud, no API
keys, no uploads.

12
00:00:23,053 --> 00:00:24,723
Even this voice
was made locally.
